ils if it includes the pom dependency:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<dependency>\r\n  <groupId>io.quarkus</groupId>\r\n  <artifactId>quarkus-opentelemetry-exporter-otlp</artifactId>\r\n</dependency>\r\n```\r\nwith quarkus.version set to 2.0.0.Final\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nThe build should succeed\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\nThe following native build error occurs:\r\n\r\n```\r\n...\r\n[demo-0.0.3-SNAPSHOT-runner:25]     analysis: 269,454.77 ms,  3.31 GB\r\nError: com.oracle.graal.pointsto.constraints.UnresolvedElementException: Discovered unresolved type during parsing: io.grpc.netty.shaded.io.grpc.netty.NettyChannelBuilder. To diagnose the issue you can use the --allow-incomplete-classpath option. The missing type is then reported at run time when it is accessed the first time.\r\nDetailed message:\r\nTrace:\r\n        at parsing io.opentelemetry.exporter.otlp.trace.OtlpGrpcSpanExporterBuilder.build(OtlpGrpcSpanExporterBuilder.java:164)\r\nCall path from entry point to io.opentelemetry.exporter.otlp.trace.OtlpGrpcSpanExporterBuilder.build():\r\n        at io.opentelemetry.exporter.otlp.trace.OtlpGrpcSpanExporterBuilder.build(OtlpGrpcSpanExporterBuilder.java:127)\r\n        at io.quarkus.opentelemetry.exporter.otlp.runtime.OtlpRecorder.installBatchSpanProcessorForOtlp(OtlpRecorder.java:28)\r\n        at io.quarkus.deployment.steps.OtlpExporterProcessor$installBatchSpanProcessorForOtlp-727556406.deploy_0(OtlpExporterProcessor$installBatchSpanProcessorForOtlp-727556406.zig:85)\r\n        at io.quarkus.deployment.steps.OtlpExporterProcessor$installBatchSpanProcessorForOtlp-727556406.deploy(OtlpExporterProcessor$installBatchSpanProcessorForOtlp-727556406.zig:40)\r\n        at io.quarkus.runner.ApplicationImpl.doStart(ApplicationImpl.zig:643)\r\n```\r\n\r\nNB: replacing the otlp  exporter with the jaeger exporter makes the error go away.\r\n\r\n## Environment (please complete the following information):\r\n\r\n### Output of `uname -a` or `ver`\r\n\r\nMicrosoft Windows [Version 10.0.18363.1500]\r\n\r\n### Output of `java -version`\r\n\r\nJava Version 11.0.11+8-jvmci-21.1-b05\r\n\r\n### GraalVM version (if different from Java)\r\n\r\nGraalVM 21.1.0 Java 11 CE\r\n\r\n### Quarkus version or git rev\r\n\r\n2.0.0.Final\r\n\r\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\r\n\r\nApache Maven 3.8.1\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/18314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/18314/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}